Model Portfolios documentation:
===============================
https://api.ibkr.com/gw/swagger-ui.html#/Trading%20FA%20Allocation%20Management
https://www.interactivebrokers.com/campus/ibkr-api-page/webapi-ref/#tag/Trading-FA-Allocation-Management/paths/~1fa~1fa-preset~1get/post

cURL - CP Gateway
==================
Initialize (IServer) Brokerage Session
curl -k -X POST "https://localhost:5000/v1/api/iserver/auth/ssodh/init" -H "accept: application/json" -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d "{\"publish\":true, \"compete\":true}"

Allocation Models
curl -k -X GET "https://localhost:5000/v1/api/iserver/account/allocation/models" -H "accept: application/json"

Get Preset
curl -k -X POST "https://localhost:5000/v1/api/fa/fa-preset/get" -H "accept: application/json" -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d "{ \"reqID\": 128, \"subscriptionKey\":\"\"}"
 
Set Preset
curl -k -X POST "https://localhost:5000/v1/api/fa/fa-preset/save" -H "accept: application/json" -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d "{\"reqID\":129,\"roundAllocExchBoardLot\":false,\"cashQtyEstimateFactor\":25,\"keepModelOpen\":false,\"useNonBaseCcy\":false,\"closeDivestCorePosition\":true,\"preferTransferFromIndependent\":true,\"preferCrossWithIndependent\":false,\"fullyInvestExistingLongPositions\":false,\"avoidNegativeCashInCore\":false,\"useToleranceRange\":false, \"subscriptionKey\":\"\"}"

Model List
curl -k -X POST "https://localhost:5000/v1/api/fa/model/list" -H "accept: application/json" -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d "{ \"reqID\": 123, \"subscriptionKey\":\"\"}"

Model Accounts Details
curl -k -X POST "https://localhost:5000/v1/api/fa/model/accounts-details" -H "accept: application/json" -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d "{ \"calcPnls\": true, \"model\":\"MCPAPI-DEMO\", \"reqID\": 124, \"subscriptionKey\":\"\"}"

Model Summary
curl -k -X POST "https://localhost:5000/v1/api/fa/model/summary" -H "accept: application/json" -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d "{\"reqID\":125,\"model\":\"MCPAPI-DEMO\", \"subscriptionKey\":\"\"}"

Model Positions
curl -k -X POST "https://localhost:5000/v1/api/fa/model/positions" -H "accept: application/json" -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d "{\"reqID\":126,\"model\":\"MCPAPI-DEMO\",\"sortField\":\"actl\",\"sortDirection\":\"DESC\",\"limit\":10, \"subscriptionKey\":\"\"}"

Create/Edit Model
curl -k -X POST "https://localhost:5000/v1/api/fa/model/save" -H "accept: application/json" -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d "{\"reqID\":127,\"model\":\"MCPAPI-DEMO\",\"desc\":\"MCPAPI-DEMO-LongOnly\",\"isStatic\":false,\"positionTargets\":[{\"cid\":270639,\"trgt\":0.45},{\"cid\":268084,\"trgt\":0.45}],\"cashTargets\":[{\"ccy\":\"USD\",\"trgt\":0.1}], \"subscriptionKey\":\"\"}"
  
Invest Divest (invest $10000)
curl -k -X POST "https://localhost:5000/v1/api/fa/model/invest-divest" -H "accept: application/json" -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d "{\"reqID\":130,\"model\":\"MCPAPI-DEMO\",\"accountList\":[{\"account\":\"DU12345\",\"amtToInvest\":10000}], \"subscriptionKey\":\"\"}"

Invest Divest Positions
curl -k -X POST "https://localhost:5000/v1/api/fa/model/invest-divest-positions" -H "accept: application/json" -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d "{\"reqID\":131,\"model\":\"MCPAPI-DEMO\", \"subscriptionKey\":\"\"}"
 
Submit Transfers
curl -k -X POST "https://localhost:5000/v1/api/fa/model/submit-transfers" -H "accept: application/json" -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d " {\"reqID\":132,\"fpOrderId\":1, \"subscriptionKey\":\"\"}"
 
Invest Divest (target amount $5000 -> effectively divest $5000)
curl -k -X POST "https://localhost:5000/v1/api/fa/model/invest-divest" -H "accept: application/json" -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d "{\"reqID\":133,\"model\":\"MCPAPI-DEMO\",\"accountList\":[{\"account\":\"DU12345\",\"targetAmt\":5000}], \"subscriptionKey\":\"\"}"

Rebalance to New Targets
curl -k -X POST "https://localhost:5000/v1/api/fa/model/rebalance/to-new-targets" -H "accept: application/json" -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d "{\"reqID\": 398896, \"model\": \"MCPAPI-DEMO\", \"positionTargets\":
[{\"conid\": 268084, \"target\": 0.35, \"locked\": false}, {\"conid\": 270639, \"target\": 0.5, \"locked\": false}], \"cashTargets\": [{\"ccy\": \"USD\", \"target\": 0.15, \"locked\": false}], \"subscriptionKey\": \"\"}"

Rebalance to Specific Targets
curl -k -X POST "https://localhost:5000/v1/api/fa/model/rebalance/to-specific-targets" -H "accept: application/json" -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d "{\"reqID\": 398899, \"model\": \"MCPAPI-DEMO\", \"positionTargets\":
[{\"cid\": 270639, \"trgt\": 0.3, \"locked\": false}, {\"cid\": 76792991, \"trgt\": 0.3, \"locked\": false}, {\"cid\": 8314, \"trgt\": 0.3, \"locked\": false}], \"subscriptionKey\": \"\"}"



